      "content": "i'm still able to talk but the weakness in my arm is getting a bit worse and i'm feeling kinda dizzy too. if i'm going to try to sleep it off like you said, is there a specific amount of tylenol i should take to make sure it works? and like, is it okay to take it with some of that ibuprofen you mentioned earlier? i just want to make sure i'm doing enough to help it go away so i don't end up having to go to the hospital after all.",
